    {
      "id": "b3",
      "function": "explanation",
      "scene_type": "rv_chart",
      "spoken": "Here is the pressure in the cylinder, as a schematic. Fire too early and the pressure rises while the piston is still coming up. Fire too late and it only arrives once the piston is already heading down. These curves are a schematic, not a measurement.",
